 "input": "rescue adoption process for volunteers. people browse dogs on the website, every dog has a profile written by the kennel team after their behaviour assessment. they fill the adoption application online. rehoming officer reviews it and calls them. home check by a volunteer (fence height, other pets etc). then meet the dog at the centre, maybe a few visits. vet check before leaving: microchip registered to the new owner, vaccinations, neutering. adoption fee paid and contract signed. aftercare team calls at 1 week and 6 weeks. dogs that come back go back into kennels and get reassessed.",
